{
  "challenges": [
    {
      "publicId": "chal_coding_gcn_132",
      "name": "order-validation-problem-details",
      "type": "fix_bug",
      "title": "Fix the order validation",
      "description": "Last month's gateway check for `POST /v1/orders` refused the iOS app's orders (it sends `application/json; charset=utf-8`), silently dropped a misspelled field, and reported only the first invalid field, so the app showed one error at a time. The editor holds the check (`main.go`) with the faulty blocks missing, each marked by a `// [ ]` line; some pieces are the original buggy blocks. Fill every line so that: JSON with any parameters is accepted and anything else gets 415; unknown fields and broken JSON get 400; every invalid field is listed in one 422; and refusals use the `application/problem+json` media type. Run checks test bodies and prints the status, the media type and the problem or the parsed order.",
      "difficulty": "medium",
      "outcomes": [
        "http-middleware"
      ],
      "points": 30,
      "hints": [
        "Send the three bodies from the bug report through the check in your head: what does each block do with `; charset=utf-8`, with `\"promoCode\"`, and with two bad fields?",
        "Look at splitting a media type at `;`, `json.Decoder.DisallowUnknownFields`, collecting `FieldError`s in a slice instead of returning at the first one, and the media type RFC 9457 defines.",
        "A courier sign-up check with the same shape: `mt := strings.TrimSpace(strings.Split(ct, \";\")[0])`, `dec.DisallowUnknownFields()`, append one `FieldError` per bad field (`phone`, `vehicle`, `licenseExpiry`) and answer 422 with all of them in `errors`."
      ],
      "coding": {
        "language": "go",
        "filePath": "main.go",
        "executionMode": "stdio",
        "timeLimitMs": 3000,
        "memoryLimitMb": 128,
        "scoringMode": "all_or_nothing",
        "maxAttempts": null
      },
      "tests": [
        {
          "name": "A valid order with Content-Type application/json; charset=utf-8 passes (201)",
          "input": {
            "contentType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "body": "{\"restaurantId\":\"r-pho-24\",\"items\":[{\"menuItemId\":\"pho-bo\",\"quantity\":2},{\"menuItemId\":\"tra-da\",\"quantity\":1}],\"deliveryAddress\":\"12 Nguyen Hue, District 1\"}"
          },
          "expected": {
            "status": 201,
            "contentType": "application/json",
            "problem": null,
            "order": {
              "restaurantId": "r-pho-24",
              "items": [
                {
                  "menuItemId": "pho-bo",
                  "quantity": 2
                },
                {
                  "menuItemId": "tra-da",
                  "quantity": 1
                }
              ],
              "deliveryAddress": "12 Nguyen Hue, District 1"
            }
          },
          "hidden": false,
          "score": 5
        },
        {
          "name": "A form post is refused with 415 as problem details",
          "input": {
            "contentType": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded",
            "body": "restaurantId=r-pho-24"
          },
          "expected": {
            "status": 415,
            "contentType": "application/problem+json",
            "problem": {
              "type": "https://api.ricerocket.vn/problems/unsupported-media-type",
              "title": "Unsupported Media Type",
              "status": 415,
              "detail": "send the order as application/json"
            },
            "order": null
          },
          "hidden": false,
          "score": 5
        },
        {
          "name": "Every invalid field is reported in one 422 answer",
          "input": {
            "contentType": "application/json",
            "body": "{\"restaurantId\":\"\",\"items\":[{\"menuItemId\":\"pho-bo\",\"quantity\":0},{\"menuItemId\":\"com-tam\",\"quantity\":25}],\"deliveryAddress\":\"12 Nguyen Hue, District 1\"}"
          },
          "expected": {
            "status": 422,
            "contentType": "application/problem+json",
            "problem": {
              "type": "https://api.ricerocket.vn/problems/invalid-order",
              "title": "Invalid order",
              "status": 422,
              "detail": "3 field(s) are invalid",
              "errors": [
                {
                  "field": "restaurantId",
                  "detail": "is required"
                },
                {
                  "field": "items[0].quantity",
                  "detail": "must be between 1 and 20"
                },
                {
                  "field": "items[1].quantity",
                  "detail": "must be between 1 and 20"
                }
              ]
            },
            "order": null
          },
          "hidden": false,
          "score": 5
        },
        {
          "name": "An unknown field (a typo or an unsupported promoCode) is a 400, not silently ignored",
          "input": {
            "contentType": "application/json",
            "body": "{\"restaurantId\":\"r-pho-24\",\"items\":[{\"menuItemId\":\"pho-bo\",\"quantity\":2},{\"menuItemId\":\"tra-da\",\"quantity\":1}],\"deliveryAddress\":\"12 Nguyen Hue, District 1\",\"promoCode\":\"FREESHIP\"}"
          },
          "expected": {
            "status": 400,
            "contentType": "application/problem+json",
            "problem": {
              "type": "https://api.ricerocket.vn/problems/malformed-json",
              "title": "Malformed JSON",
              "status": 400,
              "detail": "json: unknown field \"promoCode\""
            },
            "order": null
          },
          "hidden": true,
          "score": 5
        },
        {
          "name": "A 20 KiB body is refused with 413 before it is parsed",
          "input": {
            "contentType": "application/json",
            "body": "{\"restaurantId\":\"r-pho-24\",\"items\":[{\"menuItemId\":\"pho-bo\",\"quantity\":2},{\"menuItemId\":\"tra-da\",\"quantity\":1}],\"deliveryAddress\":\"\"}"
          },
          "expected": {
            "status": 413,
            "contentType": "application/problem+json",
            "problem": {
              "type": "https://api.ricerocket.vn/problems/body-too-large",
              "title": "Content Too Large",
              "status": 413,
              "detail": "the body is over 16384 bytes"
            },
            "order": null
          },
          "hidden": true,
          "score": 5
        },
        {
          "name": "Broken JSON is a 400 with the parser's message",
          "input": {
            "contentType": "application/json",
            "body": "{\"restaurantId\": \"r-pho-24\","
          },
          "expected": {
            "status": 400,
            "contentType": "application/problem+json",
            "problem": {
              "type": "https://api.ricerocket.vn/problems/malformed-json",
              "title": "Malformed JSON",
              "status": 400,
              "detail": "unexpected EOF"
            },
            "order": null
          },
          "hidden": true,
          "score": 5
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
